  "steps": [
    "Marinate the chicken with the curd, ginger garlic paste, green chillies, chilli powder, turmeric, biryani masala, half the mint and coriander, lemon juice and half the salt for at least 1 hour.",
    "Fry the onions in the oil until deep golden brown, then mix half into the marinated chicken and keep the rest for garnish.",
    "Boil the soaked rice in plenty of water with the bay leaf and remaining salt until 70 percent cooked, then drain.",
    "Spread the chicken in a heavy pot, cover with the rice and scatter the remaining mint, coriander and fried onion.",
    "Drizzle the ghee and saffron milk on top, seal tightly with foil and a lid.",
    "Cook on high heat for 5 minutes, then on the lowest heat for 35 minutes.",
    "Rest 10 minutes, then mix from the bottom gently and serve with raita."
  ]
